# rationale: Returns baseValue^exponentValue via repeated multiplication.
# invariant: exponent == 0 always returns 1 (including 0^0).
# warning: Wraps modulo 2^64 on overflow.
# failure: Returned for exponent < 0 (integer arithmetic can't represent fractions).
