argument advancePowerCounterCall left Int64 powerCounter
argument advancePowerCounterCall right Int64 integerOneStepValue
run advancePowerCounterCall
bind value nextPowerCounter Int64 advancePowerCounterCall
set memory powerCounter nextPowerCounter
jump target powerLoop
label returnPowerProduct
return ok powerProduct
label raiseNegativeExponentError
makeError negativeExponentFailure NumericArithmeticError.NegativeExponentNotSupported
return error negativeExponentFailure

# rationale: Greatest common divisor via the Euclidean algorithm. Works on absolute values, so signs of inputs don't matter.
